stale scalar: provider type `public.stale` is a native enum stored without native enum structure; rerun `dsql introspect`
scalar payload: provider type `public.scalar_payload` has invalid structure: a scalar type cannot carry enum metadata
domain payload: provider type `public.domain_payload` has invalid structure: a domain type cannot carry enum metadata
array payload: provider type `public.array_payload` has invalid structure: an array type cannot carry enum metadata
empty: provider type `public.empty` has invalid structure: native enum types require at least one variant
missing: provider type `public.missing` has invalid structure: a native enum requires enum metadata
related: provider type `public.related` has invalid structure: an enum type cannot reference a related type
configured: provider type `public.configured` has invalid structure: only provider-declared native enums are supported
duplicate: provider type `public.duplicate` has invalid structure: duplicate enum variant "one"
duplicate database: provider type `public.duplicate_database` has invalid structure: duplicate enum database value "one"
mismatched: provider type `public.mismatched` has invalid structure: native enum variants must equal their database values
